# Workflows

## Overview
This page will contain the following sections:
    - topbar (frozen): 
      - left: Workflow Name
      - right: Add Workflow
    - content (scrollable vertically):
      - left panel: will contain the list of workflows
      - right panel: will contain the details of the workflow
        The workflow will be displayed in a flowchart form with the control flow of the workflow:
        - 1. trigger - configures the trigger input of the workflow
        - 2. detection - configures the detection of the workflow
          - 2.1 detection profiles - configures the detection profiles of the workflow
        - 4. relay outputs - configures the relay outputs of the workflow
        
        